Z||000007||Formula||10-09-2001||06:28 PM||||edelbrock torquer II dual plane for the 60 degree V6..<P>with a edelbrock 390 carb was supposedly dynoed at 270 hp @ 7000 rpms.  I never saw the dyno but the guy who built it is believable.<P>btw.. it was on a 3.2 stroker with high compression and a big cam.<P>||||reg||1
