Z||000011||DreXteR||10-11-2001||02:08 PM||||Formula - Thanx for the info. I went to edelbrock site and only found PERFORMER 2V 60° V6 or 4v. Is the same bottom plate, waht only changes is the top for 4v or 2v. <P>Thanx<P>DreX||||reg||1
Z||000012||88formula||10-11-2001||04:10 PM||||Edlebrock makes one and you can get it from PAW 1-818-678-3000.<P>Part number ede3785 for the lower and ede6942 for the four barrel top. You can also get a two barrel intake top manifold part number ede3787. <P>There is a guy here who had one custom made by Offenhauser but I cannot remember his name. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
